{'symbol': 'CFG', 'date': '2023-06-07 10:30:00', 'title': 'CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP TO CEASE ORIGINATING INDIRECT AUTO LOANS', 'text': 'PROVIDENCE, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIZENS FINANCIAL GROUP, INC. (NYSE: CFG OR “CITIZENS”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL NO LONGER ORIGINATE INDIRECT AUTO LOANS, EFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2023, AS PART OF ITS STRATEGY TO OPTIMIZE ITS BALANCE SHEET AND EMPHASIZE RELATIONSHIP-BASED LENDING. CITIZENS WILL RETAIN AND CONTINUE TO SERVICE EXISTING AUTO LOANS ON ITS BALANCE SHEET. “AS CITIZENS CONTINUES TO OPTIMIZE ITS BALANCE SHEET, THIS DECISION FURTHER ENABLES US TO LEND IN AREAS THAT PROVIDE BETTER RISK A.'}